sec.p:
The hypergraph construction algorithm has been presented in Algorithm 1.
Algorithm 1 Hypergraph Construction Algorithm
Require:
Document D with sentences S={s1,s2,…,sn}Ensure:
Hypergraph H=(V,E) 1:
Initialize V←∅ 2:
Initialize E←∅ 3:
for each sentence si∈S do 4:
vi←Embed(si) ▹ Convert sentence to embedding 5:
V←V∪{vi} 6:
end for 7:
for each pair of sentences (si,sj) do 8:
Calculate semantic similarity sim(vi,vj) 9:
if sim(vi,vj)>θs then10:
ek←{vi,vj} ▹ Create semantic hyperedge11:
E←E∪{ek}12:
end if13:
end for14:
for each consecutive pair of sentences (si,si+1) do15:
el←{vi,vi+1} ▹ Create narrative hyperedge16:
E←E∪{el}17:
end for18:
for each discourse role R do19:
DR←{vi∣role(vi)=R}20:
if |DR|>1 then21:
em←DR ▹ Create discourse hyperedge22:
E←E∪{em}23:
end if24:
end for25:
returnH=(V,E)
